1
00:00:00,934 --> 00:00:02,934
(Arthur:)Like I'm 75 again.

2
00:00:07,674 --> 00:00:08,744
(Leonard:)Oh, God.

3
00:00:08,908 --> 00:00:10,118
(Arthur:)What... what is it?

4
00:00:10,277 --> 00:00:13,087
(Leonard:)Sheldon just sent me a picture of him
and Bill Nye getting smoothies.

5
00:00:16,950 --> 00:00:19,520
(Arthur:)-Can I ask you a question?
-Yeah, sure.

6
00:00:20,620 --> 00:00:22,120
(Arthur:)Why do you put up with Sheldon?

7
00:00:23,023 --> 00:00:24,003
(Leonard:)Oh.

8
00:00:24,157 --> 00:00:25,867
(Leonard:)You know, because we're friends.

9
00:00:28,261 --> 00:00:30,141
(Sheldon:)Why?

10
00:00:31,631 --> 00:00:33,301
(Leonard:)Wow, you ask really hard questions.

11
00:00:33,466 --> 00:00:34,776
(Leonard:)Yeah.

12
00:00:34,935 --> 00:00:37,145
(Leonard:)Look, I know he can be aggravating,

13
00:00:37,303 --> 00:00:40,113
(Leonard:)but what you have to remember is that
he's not doing it on purpose.

14
00:00:40,273 --> 00:00:41,513
It's just how he ls.

15
00:00:41,675 --> 00:00:44,655
(Leonard:)But he's also loyal and trustworthy

16
00:00:44,811 --> 00:00:46,221
(Leonard:)and we have fun together.

17
00:00:46,379 --> 00:00:49,659
(Arthur:)You know you're describing a dog.

18
00:00:51,685 --> 00:00:52,895
(Leonard:)He did bite me once.

19
00:00:55,055 --> 00:00:59,025
But in his defense, I came up
behind him while he was eating.

